  "text": "Planning Document: Marrickville DCP 2011 - 9 27 Barwon Park South\n\nClause 9.27.1 - zoning (land_use_zoning): The entire precinct is reserved SP2 Infrastructure (Classified Road).\n\nClause 9.27.1 - setback (development_control): Residential lots either contain a small setback or no setback from the road.\n\nClause 9.27.1 - heritage (heritage): There are no Heritage Conservation Areas contained within the precinct.\n\nClause 9.27.2 - heritage (heritage): To protect and preserve the identified period buildings within the precinct and encourage their sympathetic alteration or restoration.\n\nClause 9.27.2 - height_limit (development_control): To maintain single storey streetscapes that existing within the precinct.\n\nClause 9.27.3 - heritage (heritage): There are no Heritage Conservation Areas contained within the precinct.\n\n",
